", "call_id": "toolu_01KctJe7EUdzmKmYnXEyyrrR", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52314, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01KctJe7EUdzmKmYnXEyyrrR", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 54394, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again (error rate 0.002, down from 0.18). The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1 was unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc only ran in staging.\n- **First attempt:** The rollback halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service mixed: us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1.\n- **Retry:** I ran the same rollback to v2.3.0 again, and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The first incident request timed out. I checked the incident list, found INC-0001 already open with the full summary, and did not create a duplicate.\n\nThe incident still lists the orchestrator partial failure as a follow-up, along with investigating why v2.3.1 failed. No deployment needed change-manager approval, since v2.3.0 has a healthy production record.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the release history and current status for checkout-api.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_013u4UFfbepdnvPR8mjQ1nep", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_019H5saYuqsmyBkYQrAFZ7r2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_se